WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.845
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:10.115 --> 00:11.533
AT A WEIRD PART-TIME JOB TO FIND YOU

3
00:11.616 --> 00:15.245
Ji-yoon, what are you talking about? Wait, no. Hold on!

4
00:16.454 --> 00:17.372
BYEON JI-YOON

5
00:17.455 --> 00:19.249
Ji-yoon! What?

6
00:19.332 --> 00:20.750
Come on, hey, no!

7
00:24.754 --> 00:27.298
Goddamn it. Where the hell am I?

8
00:29.843 --> 00:31.344
Sh… What the…

9
00:33.388 --> 00:35.223
Is anyone out there?!

10
00:36.391 --> 00:38.726
Hello? Is anyone there?!

11
00:40.061 --> 00:43.898
Where the fuck am I? How did I get here?!

12
00:52.198 --> 00:53.658
Hey! Excuse me!

13
00:53.741 --> 00:56.369
- Should we give that guy a ride? - Please pull over!

14
00:56.452 --> 00:59.247
No way. Just keep on going. We're not a taxi.

15
00:59.330 --> 01:01.249
Please! No, no, no, wait!

16
01:02.625 --> 01:04.752
Ah, sh…

17
01:09.549 --> 01:11.134
IT'S JUST MY FATE

18
01:11.217 --> 01:14.053
♪ It's just my fate ♪

19
01:15.013 --> 01:18.141
♪ I fly high, riding the good vibes ♪

20
01:18.224 --> 01:21.186
- ♪ And laugh my way out of reality ♪ - Ji-yoon, please.

21
01:21.269 --> 01:24.230
Just turn on already! Agh, let's go!

22
01:29.235 --> 01:31.696
The number you have dialed is unavail--

23
01:39.078 --> 01:43.416
SPIDER STAFFING AGENCY

24
01:44.125 --> 01:46.502
What? They're "out on business?"

25
01:46.586 --> 01:47.795
OUT ON BUSINESS

26
02:02.477 --> 02:04.687
Hey, sir, please!

27
02:04.771 --> 02:06.231
You need to let me in!

28
02:18.326 --> 02:20.286
I'm out of the office at the moment.

29
02:20.370 --> 02:22.830
There are currently no temp jobs available.

30
02:23.706 --> 02:26.334
Ms. Ji-yoon should be fine for the time being.

31
02:26.417 --> 02:29.712
I have a lot of questions to ask you, Mr. Hyeok-jun.

32
02:29.796 --> 02:31.047
Let's meet soon.

33
02:37.762 --> 02:39.389
Shi…

34
02:46.396 --> 02:52.902
EUM YEON-JOO

35
02:55.738 --> 02:56.948
Why was I such an idiot?

36
02:57.031 --> 03:01.744
I never should have sent that text telling her to go to Spider Staffing Agency!

37
03:04.622 --> 03:06.249
Maybe you should go look for her.

38
03:08.293 --> 03:11.337
If Ji-yoon is safe, what's the most likely place for her to be?

39
03:12.005 --> 03:14.424
I'll bet it's wherever the temp gig is today.

40
03:15.133 --> 03:17.760
I know that today's job is gonna be at the hospital.

41
03:18.970 --> 03:21.681
I wasn't offered a gig today. How will I know what to do?

42
03:21.764 --> 03:24.183
I can't even reach him or anything. The whole office is empty!

43
03:24.267 --> 03:26.060
If you don't get the offer, steal the job.

44
03:27.895 --> 03:28.980
What are you saying?

45
03:29.063 --> 03:32.317
You know that you're not the only temp worker at Spider Staffing Agency,

46
03:32.400 --> 03:33.776
don't you, Hyeok-jun?

47
03:37.488 --> 03:39.365
The agency staffs very competitive people

48
03:39.449 --> 03:41.784
who are always working harder and moving faster.

49
03:41.868 --> 03:43.786
One of them is Seon Gyeong-min.

50
03:44.287 --> 03:46.748
He's the same age as you and has a similar build.

51
03:47.707 --> 03:49.334
- You know what you should do, right? - I…

52
03:49.417 --> 03:50.835
Take his spot at the job.

53
03:51.377 --> 03:53.129
So, I'm just supposed to… what?

54
03:53.671 --> 03:55.757
I should steal his phone? I don't know how I'm gonna--

55
03:55.840 --> 03:58.009
Didn't you reach out to me to ask for help?

56
04:00.261 --> 04:02.221
I knew this would happen, so I prepared.

57
04:02.305 --> 04:04.057
I just borrowed his phone for a little bit.

58
04:04.140 --> 04:07.060
All you have to do is text "accept" and you become Seon Gyeong-min.

59
04:07.643 --> 04:08.478
Hm.

60
05:06.828 --> 05:09.789
DEAD-END JOB

61
05:11.082 --> 05:14.043
CLINICAL TRIAL

62
05:32.228 --> 05:33.312
Where am I?

63
05:50.997 --> 05:52.415
The movie theater.

64
06:00.381 --> 06:01.966
What is this?

65
06:06.345 --> 06:07.638
Hyeok-jun?

66
06:15.313 --> 06:17.315
Is that a convenience store?

67
06:27.992 --> 06:30.203
What the hell is going on here?!

68
06:37.585 --> 06:38.419
What?

69
06:48.846 --> 06:49.680
Shit!

70
07:21.963 --> 07:24.507
Oh my God, where am I now? Fuck this.

71
07:29.887 --> 07:32.348
Oh my goodness. You must have run all the way here.

72
07:32.431 --> 07:33.683
Mr. Seon Gyeong-min?

73
07:34.308 --> 07:36.811
Uh, yes, I'm Seon Gyeong-min. Here's my info.

74
07:36.894 --> 07:39.689
All right, Seon Gyeong-min. I'll mark down that you're here.

75
07:40.773 --> 07:44.569
- You're not ill, are you? - Oh, no, no, I'm okay. I'm totally fine.

76
07:44.652 --> 07:46.195
- Are you sure? - Yeah.

77
07:47.405 --> 07:50.199
Okay, all 16 of you are here now.

78
07:50.783 --> 07:53.452
Please follow me upstairs and I'll explain everything.

79
07:53.536 --> 07:54.620
Come with me.

80
07:58.082 --> 08:00.543
YANGCHEON BIO CLINIC CLINICAL TRIAL ? TIMES THE DAILY WAGE

81
08:00.626 --> 08:01.836
STARTS AT 10 P.M. ENDS AT 6 A.M.

82
08:15.516 --> 08:16.809
All right.

83
08:17.310 --> 08:19.228
You'll all be taking some medication today.

84
08:19.312 --> 08:21.856
It's in this bottle. Just relax.

85
08:21.939 --> 08:25.359
These pills are not at all dangerous, so there's no need to worry.

86
08:26.027 --> 08:29.238
It's a copy of a nerve-calming supplement that's already on the market.

87
08:29.739 --> 08:31.907
All you have to do today is take this pill,

88
08:31.991 --> 08:35.161
and then you'll get your blood drawn an hour afterwards.

89
08:36.370 --> 08:37.455
Please line up here.

90
08:37.538 --> 08:40.666
The front of the line will be first to get their blood drawn and take the pill.

91
08:40.750 --> 08:41.626
Step forward.

92
08:42.126 --> 08:44.462
- This line, this side. - Towards me.

93
08:47.298 --> 08:49.634
- What's your name? - Hey, Gyeong-min.

94
08:52.928 --> 08:54.680
Hey, wh… what are you doing here?

95
08:56.098 --> 08:59.268
I, uh… It's because of the message you got.

96
08:59.935 --> 09:01.103
Ah, sh…

97
09:01.187 --> 09:02.563
SPIDER STAFFING AGENCY BOSS

98
09:02.647 --> 09:05.232
The place that hooks you up with super easy gigs.

99
09:07.485 --> 09:09.362
- Did you change your name or something? - Ah, shi…

100
09:09.445 --> 09:11.489
What's up with "Gyeong-min?" I'm a little confused--

101
09:11.572 --> 09:13.157
Nothing. I'll tell you a little later.

102
09:14.075 --> 09:16.786
Why'd you come here when you're way too sick for this?

103
09:19.955 --> 09:22.416
Don't you dare take that pill, man. You got it?

104
09:22.500 --> 09:24.335
There could be something really bad in it.

105
09:25.795 --> 09:27.129
They pay you for taking the meds.

106
09:27.213 --> 09:29.674
- Believe me, there might be-- - Can you lower your voice?

107
09:29.757 --> 09:30.591
Oh, okay.

108
09:33.594 --> 09:35.304
Please clench your fist tightly.

109
09:47.525 --> 09:48.943
You can relax now.

110
09:52.113 --> 09:54.448
You seem to be very interested in the process.

111
09:56.200 --> 09:58.494
Here. Go ahead and take this.

112
10:01.163 --> 10:04.250
It could get stuck in your throat, so drink plenty of water.

113
10:16.262 --> 10:17.388
And open your mouth.

114
10:20.099 --> 10:21.684
You swallowed it, right?

115
10:35.156 --> 10:36.657
Ah, sh…

116
10:39.869 --> 10:40.995
Oh, shit!

117
10:42.413 --> 10:44.707
Hey, these are really good.

118
10:45.374 --> 10:47.585
My mind is… …so calm.

119
10:48.294 --> 10:49.628
Goddamn it. Come on.

120
10:53.215 --> 10:55.176
Is Ji-yoon even here?

121
10:56.385 --> 10:57.803
What did you say?

122
10:58.304 --> 10:59.764
Hey, follow me.

123
11:05.269 --> 11:07.897
- Where are you going? - I just need to use the restroom.

124
11:07.980 --> 11:09.273
Get back to where you were.

125
11:10.357 --> 11:12.943
Seon Gyeong-min, sir. Where do you think you're going?

126
11:13.778 --> 11:15.863
I have to use the restroom as soon as possible.

127
11:16.614 --> 11:18.157
You need the restroom?

128
11:18.783 --> 11:21.619
Just wait one hour until it's available. Please hold it in till then.

129
11:21.702 --> 11:24.789
You can't stop me. I really need to use the restroom right now!

130
11:24.872 --> 11:26.540
Mr. Seon Gyeong-min!

131
11:27.041 --> 11:30.711
If you don't go back to your designated place right now, you'll be quarantined.

132
11:31.545 --> 11:36.133
DANGER DO NOT REMOVE PROTECTIVE SUIT

133
11:41.722 --> 11:43.015
Hello, Director. It's me.

134
11:43.098 --> 11:44.934
Everything's going smoothly?

135
11:45.017 --> 11:48.103
Yes, all 17 subjects seem to be in good condition.

136
11:48.604 --> 11:51.857
What do you mean "17?" Weren't there 16 people in total?

137
11:51.941 --> 11:54.193
Well, there's an additional person,

138
11:54.276 --> 11:56.529
but the subject will be moved shortly.

139
11:56.612 --> 11:57.655
Oh, that's good,

140
11:57.738 --> 12:00.366
but, Doctor, it sounds like that is keeping you very busy.

141
12:00.950 --> 12:01.784
Yeah.

142
12:02.284 --> 12:05.120
Well, I trust you. Just do it cleanly.

143
12:05.621 --> 12:06.455
Yes.

144
12:27.977 --> 12:29.436
Huh?

145
12:56.964 --> 12:57.965
Hurry up.

146
13:07.308 --> 13:08.434
What are you doing?

147
13:20.654 --> 13:22.781
Take the cart down to the basement after this.

148
13:39.715 --> 13:41.008
Hey, stop her!

149
13:53.312 --> 13:54.939
Ah, fuck me.

150
13:55.898 --> 13:58.859
So, you're saying that your sister might be here?

151
13:58.943 --> 14:00.027
I don't get it.

152
14:00.110 --> 14:01.987
If she's with us in the hospital,

153
14:03.030 --> 14:04.657
can't you ask the staff where she is?

154
14:09.620 --> 14:13.832
Yo, yo, you haven't listened to a word I've said, have you?

155
14:13.916 --> 14:17.962
I told you that this place is dangerous, you son of a goddamn dumbass!

156
14:18.462 --> 14:19.296
Okay.

157
14:19.797 --> 14:22.424
I need you to help me out just this once, man.

158
14:23.926 --> 14:24.843
Know what?

159
14:26.095 --> 14:29.974
My body is totally messed up anyway, so I can go method as fuck with this.

160
14:30.891 --> 14:34.144
But, hey, this means we're even on my hospital bill.

161
14:36.438 --> 14:38.774
No way. The bill I covered?

162
14:39.274 --> 14:41.485
Just buy me some pork belly and we're square.

163
14:42.486 --> 14:44.947
Man, this guy really fucking loves pork belly.

164
14:45.447 --> 14:46.865
Well, let's give it a shot.

165
14:47.574 --> 14:49.785
Okay, I think it's about time. Get ready.

166
14:50.995 --> 14:52.788
- Action! - Oh, my stomach!

167
14:52.871 --> 14:53.914
Agh! Oh my god!

168
14:53.998 --> 14:56.291
- Help! Please! Someone! - Hurry, let's go!

169
14:56.375 --> 14:57.960
What's going on?

170
14:58.043 --> 15:00.879
- Is someone hurt? - You have to get back inside!

171
15:03.215 --> 15:05.759
Why is he doing that all of a sudden?

172
15:05.843 --> 15:07.720
Kwak Byeong-cheol, please calm down!

173
15:07.803 --> 15:09.513
Ow!

174
15:11.098 --> 15:13.100
Let me take a look. Say, "Ah."

175
15:13.183 --> 15:15.394
Let's see your ears.

176
15:15.477 --> 15:18.605
I said my stomach hurts. Why are you checking random places?

177
15:19.106 --> 15:21.734
Your nose is okay too. There's nothing wrong with you.

178
15:21.817 --> 15:23.861
Don't worry. You seem to be perfectly fine.

179
15:23.944 --> 15:25.904
Doctor, look! That guy's leaving!

180
15:26.488 --> 15:27.406
Oh no!

181
15:31.660 --> 15:33.537
Ji-yoon, where are you?!

182
15:36.540 --> 15:37.708
Hey!

183
15:38.292 --> 15:39.376
Stop right there!

184
15:41.128 --> 15:42.921
Stop! Get him!

185
15:45.215 --> 15:46.925
Let me go right now!

186
15:47.009 --> 15:48.385
Get this off! Let me go!

187
15:48.469 --> 15:50.971
What the fuck is wrong with you, assholes? Stop this! Let me out!

188
15:51.055 --> 15:53.891
What are you doing? I need to get out!

189
15:53.974 --> 15:56.518
Help me! Please! Someone help!

190
15:56.602 --> 15:57.478
Ji-yoon.

191
16:03.650 --> 16:04.610
Hey, Ji-yoon!

192
16:04.693 --> 16:07.404
- Let me go now! Help, I need to get out! - Ji-yoon!

193
16:07.488 --> 16:08.739
I'm coming!

194
16:09.364 --> 16:11.075
Get off! Let me go!

195
16:11.158 --> 16:12.159
- Hey! - Stop!

196
16:12.242 --> 16:14.995
No! Get away! I'm coming, Ji-yoon!

197
16:39.853 --> 16:42.356
Hey! Wake up, Hyeok-jun!

198
16:42.856 --> 16:45.567
You have to get up. Come on, let's go!

199
16:46.819 --> 16:47.820
Hey, Hyeok-jun!

200
16:47.903 --> 16:49.196
God! Oh my God.

201
16:49.279 --> 16:51.281
Shh! Shh, shh, shh.

202
16:51.990 --> 16:54.493
- Are you okay, Hyeok-jun? - Ji-yoon. Why are you here?

203
16:55.160 --> 16:57.287
Wanna start by telling me why you're here?

204
16:58.455 --> 17:01.083
Never mind. Untie me first. Come on!

205
17:01.166 --> 17:03.377
Hurry up, come here.

206
17:03.460 --> 17:05.420
Oh, I'll come to you. I need to get over there.

207
17:06.964 --> 17:08.173
Mine just won't move at all!

208
17:09.383 --> 17:11.969
- Grab on to my hand! - My hand, grab it! Goddamn it.

209
17:12.052 --> 17:14.555
- Foot! Give me your foot! - My foot, come on. Untie it! Come on.

210
17:15.889 --> 17:18.016
Did you get it? Did you? Just slip it!

211
17:19.268 --> 17:21.019
- Get mine untied. - You got it.

212
17:21.103 --> 17:23.856
Pull it that way. Let's go, hurry! Okay, hold on.

213
17:23.939 --> 17:26.066
- Yeah, you got it! Oh, you got it. - Oh!

214
17:26.692 --> 17:27.943
Let's go!

215
17:28.819 --> 17:30.279
- Hey, your nose! - What?

216
17:30.362 --> 17:31.905
- Nose, nose! - What's wrong?

217
17:31.989 --> 17:34.491
- Nose, nose, nose, nose, nose! - Nose?

218
17:40.706 --> 17:42.875
- Oh God! My God! What is this? - Pull it out!

219
17:42.958 --> 17:45.127
- No, don't pull it out! - What's happening?!

220
17:45.627 --> 17:48.881
You can't take it out. Not yet! Why did it come out so fast?

221
17:53.260 --> 17:55.429
No, get away. Stay back! Leave us alone!

222
18:06.607 --> 18:08.233
Agh!

223
18:08.984 --> 18:09.985
Agh!

224
18:25.709 --> 18:26.960
What the fuck?

225
18:28.754 --> 18:30.088
The pills weren't the problem.

226
18:34.468 --> 18:35.886
It wasn't the pills.

227
18:37.012 --> 18:38.222
It was the water.

228
18:39.848 --> 18:41.808
Your nose is bleeding! What's wrong?

229
18:41.892 --> 18:43.852
Get it together. We need to get out of here!

230
18:47.773 --> 18:49.691
Run!

231
18:50.901 --> 18:52.861
- What the hell is going on? - Get away!

232
18:54.780 --> 18:56.907
- Hyeok-jun! - A monster is right behind us!

233
18:56.990 --> 18:59.284
- I can't let you through! - Let go of me!

234
19:25.811 --> 19:27.229
Oh. Oh!

235
19:44.246 --> 19:45.163
No!

236
19:54.089 --> 19:56.758
Hey, get up! Look alive. We have to go right now!

237
19:57.843 --> 20:00.304
Let's go! Go! Oh.

238
20:15.902 --> 20:17.112
Oh, come on! No!

239
20:17.195 --> 20:19.823
Please work. Come on, come on!

240
20:27.581 --> 20:28.582
Oh, oh!

241
20:35.422 --> 20:36.256
Oh. Oh!

242
20:50.103 --> 20:51.271
Uh, uh…

243
20:59.446 --> 21:01.239
What the hell is this?

244
21:01.323 --> 21:02.532
Why is no one here?

245
21:04.493 --> 21:06.870
- Stairs! We can take those. - Hold on a minute.

246
21:06.953 --> 21:08.747
- What? No! - I have something I gotta check.

247
21:08.830 --> 21:10.957
- Give me five seconds, okay? - Hey!

248
21:11.666 --> 21:13.710
I know I'm gonna regret it if I don't go.

249
21:14.211 --> 21:16.129
I'll be back in just a minute. Wait right here.

250
21:16.213 --> 21:18.340
Hey, no, Hyeok-jun! Come back! Hey!

251
21:18.840 --> 21:20.801
Goddamn it.

252
21:20.884 --> 21:22.344
Oh, Hyeok-jun…

253
21:25.722 --> 21:27.474
Ah, come on.

254
22:24.573 --> 22:27.075
Get up! Come on. We gotta go.

255
22:27.159 --> 22:28.785
We need to get out of here right now!

256
22:28.869 --> 22:31.079
- Is it over? - What do you mean? Let's go!

257
22:31.163 --> 22:33.457
- Wait. Look at me. - What about the others?

258
22:35.000 --> 22:37.878
- What's wrong with you? Is that blood? - You're fine. Let's get out of here.

259
22:38.378 --> 22:39.629
You're bleeding.

260
22:40.380 --> 22:42.257
Ah, sh…

261
22:43.800 --> 22:46.636
Are you crazy? You wanna get us all killed or what?

262
22:47.304 --> 22:50.098
Come on, this way! Keep going. Try to stay awake, please!

263
22:50.182 --> 22:53.226
- But I just don't get it. - Hurry, pick up the pace. Let's go!

264
22:53.310 --> 22:57.063
- I can't carry you down the stairs! - I feel so weird. But I'm so tired.

265
22:59.691 --> 23:01.526
- Is this the way? - It is.

266
23:02.277 --> 23:05.447
Please slow down a little. I think I'm gonna throw up.

267
23:05.530 --> 23:07.699
Do it outside! We can't slow down.

268
23:07.782 --> 23:09.117
Where are we going?

269
23:15.040 --> 23:16.041
All right.

270
23:17.167 --> 23:19.169
- Damn it! Why isn't this opening? - Why won't it work?

271
23:19.669 --> 23:21.963
- Hello, down there! - Oh.

272
23:22.464 --> 23:24.925
Are you trying to leave?

273
23:25.008 --> 23:29.095
You'll find that door won't open. Hold on for a second. Hm?

274
23:30.722 --> 23:32.974
- Who the hell is that? - I have no idea who it is.

275
23:45.904 --> 23:49.115
Using that to try and threaten me won't get the door open, okay?

276
23:49.199 --> 23:52.536
That door will stay locked unless I open it.

277
23:53.203 --> 23:57.249
I'm not Seon Gyeong-min, ma'am. I'm sorry, there was a misunderstanding.

278
23:57.332 --> 23:59.292
We don't need payment. We just wanna go.

279
23:59.376 --> 24:01.711
She didn't even come here to work, and uh, he, uh…

280
24:01.795 --> 24:03.421
He showed up for the first time today.

281
24:03.505 --> 24:06.091
- What? I'm here for the money! - Man, shut up!

282
24:06.675 --> 24:09.219
Who the hell are you anyway? Huh?

283
24:09.302 --> 24:12.514
You assholes must have a reason that you're doing awful stuff like this to us!

284
24:14.808 --> 24:15.850
You want to know?

285
24:16.351 --> 24:18.770
To maintain the balance of the world.

286
24:21.314 --> 24:23.483
This may be difficult for you to understand.

287
24:23.567 --> 24:25.527
You know those monsters you saw?

288
24:25.610 --> 24:27.571
They suck the life force out of human beings,

289
24:27.654 --> 24:29.489
then gobble up all our nutrients.

290
24:29.573 --> 24:32.867
But before they're fully grown, we extract the specimens from the bodies,

291
24:32.951 --> 24:35.954
and we sacrifice them instead of using humans.

292
24:38.331 --> 24:42.043
I'll make an exception and let you go. You both aren't even supposed to be here.

293
24:42.127 --> 24:45.380
And the casualties tonight meet the sacrifice quota that's required.

294
24:46.381 --> 24:47.966
Out of humanitarianism.

295
25:01.730 --> 25:03.023
Come on, let's go.

296
25:04.190 --> 25:07.277
- But what about you, Mr. Byeong-cheol? - What?

297
25:07.360 --> 25:09.571
Ten minutes left if you want to earn the money.

298
25:10.071 --> 25:12.782
- Oh-- - Hey, no. Don't even think about it.

299
25:12.866 --> 25:15.327
- Let's go. - Come on, quick.

300
25:18.246 --> 25:20.624
No, ho… hold on for a minute. Just wait.

301
25:20.707 --> 25:22.000
J… Just wait a second!

302
25:22.500 --> 25:25.503
- Hey, no, get off! Get off! Sorry. - What are you doing?

303
25:25.587 --> 25:27.422
What are you sorry about? Just stop being crazy!

304
25:27.505 --> 25:30.091
No, you don't get it! Fuck, man.

305
25:30.175 --> 25:34.346
Hey, hey! If I walk away from this without a penny, I'm basically dead!

306
25:34.429 --> 25:37.223
- I really need this money. - Don't go back in there!

307
25:37.307 --> 25:39.267
Excuse me!

308
25:39.768 --> 25:42.270
Uh, over here. I'm coming back!

309
25:42.354 --> 25:44.356
- Hey! You're insane! - No, just let him go.

310
25:44.439 --> 25:46.566
- Back off! - There's nothing you can do!

311
25:47.317 --> 25:48.693
Stop it. Just calm down!

312
25:51.571 --> 25:54.199
You don't need to do anything more. Let's go.

313
25:55.909 --> 25:58.078
Hyeok-jun, think about Mom.

314
25:58.578 --> 26:00.205
We should go back, right?

315
26:25.897 --> 26:27.524
It's not your fault, okay?

316
26:28.108 --> 26:29.693
Just forget about everything.

317
26:38.410 --> 26:39.369
Your debt?

318
26:41.621 --> 26:43.289
Are you close to paying it off?

319
26:48.586 --> 26:50.046
There's not much left.

320
26:54.634 --> 26:55.468
Hyeok-jun?

321
26:58.096 --> 26:58.930
Yeah?

322
27:01.975 --> 27:03.601
You're not allowed to disappear.

323
27:06.062 --> 27:07.564
Not ever again, okay?

324
27:08.064 --> 27:09.733
Don't disappear like Dad did.

325
27:33.089 --> 27:33.965
Come here.

326
27:35.967 --> 27:39.679
- Oh, my sweet boy. - Where are we, Dad?

327
27:39.763 --> 27:43.266
This place? It's called a model home. Have you ever heard of one of these?

328
27:43.349 --> 27:45.351
MODEL HOME MEGA-COMPLEX RIVERVIEW APARTMENTS FOR SALE

329
27:45.435 --> 27:48.188
But, Dad, why are we actually here?

330
27:48.271 --> 27:49.814
To see our new home.

331
27:55.612 --> 27:56.488
Whoa!

332
27:57.822 --> 27:59.115
It's so nice.

333
28:04.245 --> 28:05.330
Um, but

334
28:06.122 --> 28:08.458
we can't afford this, can we?

335
28:09.375 --> 28:11.294
What?

336
28:11.377 --> 28:12.337
Hey, buddy,

337
28:13.087 --> 28:14.422
don't be worried.

338
28:14.506 --> 28:16.591
The new job I got is really good.

339
28:16.674 --> 28:18.009
So just wait a little.

340
28:18.092 --> 28:21.179
Your dad, he'll be making so much it'll be crazy!

341
28:21.262 --> 28:23.473
Really? You'll make a ton of money?

342
28:23.973 --> 28:24.974
Of course.

343
28:26.226 --> 28:27.894
I'll be flush with cash.

344
28:31.731 --> 28:33.775
I just need to finish this job.

345
28:33.858 --> 28:36.820
- You do? - I do, yeah. Of course.

346
28:37.362 --> 28:38.696
I just need to finish.

347
28:41.658 --> 28:42.867
The work I do,

348
28:44.035 --> 28:45.829
it's a really easy gig.

349
28:46.830 --> 28:48.373
It's an easy gig, Dad?

350
28:55.338 --> 28:56.965
A really easy gig.

351
28:58.341 --> 29:00.677
And then, Dad disappeared.
